     <P class=MsoNormal style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">高二年段学考期间注意事项</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7600"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">各位老师，高二学生第一次学考马上来临，感谢您的积极配合和加班加点的工作。现把年段相关事宜说明如下：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.2pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7600"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">1<FONT face=宋体>、高二学考期间在校人数见下表</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT><FONT face=宋体>：</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0200"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0200"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">2<FONT face=宋体>、周三中午布置试场，</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>13:00</FONT><FONT face=宋体>左右试场验收（估计要布置完才能吃饭，提醒学生备点零食，食堂老板那里我已经请领导沟通，会延迟收摊时间）。</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0200"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">3<FONT face=宋体>、每层的自修教室也需要布置考场，相关班级如下：二楼到五楼：</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT><FONT face=宋体>班、</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>5</FONT><FONT face=宋体>班、</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>9</FONT><FONT face=宋体>班、</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>13</FONT><FONT face=宋体>班。</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.2pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7600"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.2pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7600"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">4<FONT face=宋体>、一楼自修教室因为要迎接陈翰馥院士，需要整理干净，分配如下：</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>2106 </FONT><FONT face=宋体>：</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>2</FONT><FONT face=宋体>班；</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">2108 <FONT face=宋体>：</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>6</FONT><FONT face=宋体>班；</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>2110</FONT><FONT face=宋体>： </FONT><FONT face=Calibri>10</FONT><FONT face=宋体>班；</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>2112: 14</FONT><FONT face=宋体>班</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0200"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">5<FONT face=宋体>、</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>11</FONT><FONT face=宋体>月</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>1</FONT><FONT face=宋体>日下午</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>14:45-15:00</FONT><FONT face=宋体>熟悉试场，学生对照准考证熟悉学考选考各科试场。高二学生可到高二</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>2</FONT><FONT face=宋体>层的教室进行模拟验证。午饭后到熟悉考场的时间段里在食堂自修，不能随意地到篮球场打球，以免考前不必要的情况出现！</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">    6<FONT face=宋体>、关于晚自修：住校生不允许留在寝室（寝室锁门），请假回家的要办好请假手续。烦请班主任指定一位负责学生，晚自修本班点名后报给值班老师。晚自修教室安排见下表</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>2</FONT><FONT face=宋体>：</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 28.3pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.3500"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">7<FONT face=宋体>、关于住宿：请班主任提醒每个寝室长把请假条和请假人数及时报给宿管老师。周六上午考完后，宿舍开放到下午</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>1:00</FONT><FONT face=宋体>。请参加完考试的住校生午饭后及时离校。</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.35pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0200"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">8<FONT face=宋体>、关于白天自修：在校的走读生和住校生（寝室锁门）统一到食堂二楼自修。班级位置分配见下表</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>3</FONT><FONT face=宋体>：</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">    </SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.2pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7600"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">9<FONT face=宋体>、辛苦班主任周三上午进行考风考纪教育和应试心理指导。</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">请提醒学生考试不要迟到，不要无故缺考，不要走错试场</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">、</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">坐错位置。特别是在家复习的学生要估算好到校考试的时间。</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><BR></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">    </SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21.2pt; mso-char-indent-count: 1.7600"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">10<FONT face=宋体>、</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">11<FONT face=宋体>月</FONT><FONT face=Calibri>5</FONT><FONT face=宋体>日（周日）高</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">二</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">师生休息，住校生周日傍晚返校</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">并帮助班级把教室外的课桌椅整理进教室</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">，</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">打扫好卫生。</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">下周一</SPAN></B><B><SPAN sty